              "text": "शापः — śāpaḥ — \"a curse\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ऋषेः शापेन राजा दुःखी भवति। ṛṣeḥ śāpena rājā duḥkhī bhavati. The seer's curse makes the king unhappy."
